{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09436","headline":"种瓜 · 韦应物","name":"种瓜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"率性方卤莽，理生尤自疎。\n今年学种瓜，园圃多荒芜。\n衆草同雨露，新苗独翳如。\n直以春窘迫，过时不得锄。\n田家笑枉费，日夕转空虚。\n信非吾侪事，且读古人书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}